---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="What We Do - Operational Boundaries" description="Understand what DealyVIP provides and what we explicitly do not provide." lang="en">
  <div class="container section" style="max-width: 800px; padding-top: var(--space-xl); padding-bottom: var(--space-xl);">
    
    <h1 class="display-title" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">What We Do (And Do Not Do)</h1>
    <p class="lead text-muted" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-xl); padding-bottom: var(--space-md); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);">
      DealyVIP is a practical information and coordination platform for cross-border business. We maintain strict operational boundaries to ensure transparency and safety.
    </p>

    <h2 style="font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: var(--space-sm); color: var(--color-primary);">What DealyVIP Helps With</h2>
    <ul class="prose-list" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-xl); padding-left: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.6;">
      <li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;"><strong>Information Orientation:</strong> Verifying available information about companies and business entities using local resources.</li>
      <li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;"><strong>Understanding Limitations:</strong> Clarifying the difference between a legal registry check and operational reality.</li>
      <li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;"><strong>Visit Preparation:</strong> Helping you structure factory visits and business meetings.</li>
      <li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;"><strong>Local Coordination:</strong> Where operationally available, coordinating independent local professionals (like interpreters or observation representatives) to act as your eyes and ears on the ground.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 style="font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: var(--space-sm); color: #b91c1c;">What DealyVIP Does NOT Do</h2>
    <ul class="prose-list" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-xl); padding-left: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.6;">
      <li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;"><strong>We are not a Law Firm:</strong> We do not provide legal validation, contract review, or legal representation.</li>
      <li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;"><strong>We are not a QA Agency:</strong> Observation visits are not certified technical inspections. We do not provide ISO certification or product safety guarantees.</li>
      <li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;"><strong>We are not a Bank:</strong> We do not hold escrow, process cross-border payments, or guarantee financial security.</li>
      <li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;"><strong>We are not an automated Database:</strong> We do not possess a global database of companies. We perform research using available local state-owned registries, public records, and on-the-ground inquiries on your behalf.</li>
    </ul>

    <div style="background: #f8fafc; padding: var(--space-lg); border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;">
      <h3 style="font-size: 1.2rem; margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);">The Core Principle</h3>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem; font-weight: 500;">INFORMATION ≠ GUARANTEE</p>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem; font-weight: 500;">REGISTRY CHECK ≠ FULL DUE DILIGENCE</p>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 0; font-weight: 500;">LOCAL COORDINATION ≠ CERTIFIED INSPECTION</p>
    </div>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  .prose-list li { color: var(--color-text); }
  .prose-list strong { color: var(--color-slate-900); }
</style>
